{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the model block so that each parameter receives its built-in prior before being used in any later sampling statement. The protected observation `y` remains a top-level data variable and is observed exactly once with `y ~ normal(...)`. No data fields were added or changed.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=1> N; // observations
  int<lower=1> J; // counties
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=J> county;
  vector[N] x;
  vector[N] y;
}
parameters {
  real mu_alpha;
  real<lower=0> sigma_alpha;
  vector<offset=mu_alpha, multiplier=sigma_alpha>[J] alpha; // non-centered parameterization
  real beta;
  real<lower=0> sigma;
}
model {
  beta ~ normal(0, 10);
  sigma ~ normal(0, 10);
  mu_alpha ~ normal(0, 10);
  sigma_alpha ~ normal(0, 10);
  alpha ~ normal(mu_alpha, sigma_alpha); // partial-pooling
  y ~ normal(alpha[county] + beta * x, sigma);
}
generated quantities {
  array[N] real y_rep = normal_rng(alpha[county] + beta * x, sigma);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"J":5,"N":4,"county":[1,1,1,1],"x":[2.983236171268429,5.156102842032854,4.923403252230173,6.947200869764695],"y":[2.0,3.0,4.0,2.0]}","protected_variables":["y"]}
